{
  "name": "hello-bundle",
  "version": "1.0",
  "entries": {
    "terminal": {
      "type": "html",
      "content": "<div style='font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;color:#4a6080;line-height:1.6;padding:2px 4px'><span style='color:#0af'>demuxer init</span> — terminal ready<br><span style='color:#00ff88'>✓</span> flex sensors: OK<br><span style='color:#00ff88'>✓</span> IMU: OK<br><span style='color:#00ff88'>✓</span> foil contacts: OK<br><span style='color:#ffcc00'>?</span> touchscreen: initializing...</div>"
    },
    "docs": {
      "type": "md",
      "content": "# hello glove\n\nbasic demuxer app showing all sensor inputs.\n\n## controls\n\n- **RECAL** — recalibrate all sensors\n- **PROFILE** — cycle through profiles\n- **LOCK** — lock touchscreen\n\n## gestures\n\n| gesture | action |\n|---------|--------|\n| jerk forward | melee |\n| jerk back | block |\n| twist | reload |\n\n## foil contacts\n\n- A: confirm\n- B: back\n- C: push to talk\n- D: modifier\n- RECAL: hold 3s to recalibrate"
    },
    "config": {
      "type": "json",
      "content": {
        "grip_threshold": 0.65,
        "haptic_confirm_hz": 150,
        "haptic_confirm_ms": 60,
        "log_scrollback": 50
      }
    },
    "boot_script": {
      "type": "py",
      "content": "print('hello.dmxi boot script loaded')\nconfig = json.loads(dmxi['config']['content'])\ngrip_threshold = config['grip_threshold']"
    }
  }
}
